\f1\b0 \
This installer sets up the Loombre media server, worker, and web UI as background system services (LaunchDaemons), running as a dedicated, unprivileged service account (_loombre). It bundles its own Node.js runtime, ffmpeg, and PostgreSQL \'97 nothing else on your Mac is required or modified outside the paths listed in the accompanying README.\
This build is UNSIGNED (Loombre does not pay for an Apple Developer ID \'97 see docs/install/macos.md in the repository for exactly why, and for the checksum and signature verification steps that are the real trust mechanism for an unsigned open-source installer). Gatekeeper will show a warning the first time you try to open it; that is expected.\
